<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it" class="sidebar sidebar-discover">

<head>
    <title>BKY - Annuncio Moscarossa</title>
    <%- include('../../partials/head'); %>
    <style>
        .moscarossa-logo {
            width: 260px;
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            margin: 8px 0 20px;
        }

        .moscarossa-contact-options label {
            margin-right: 24px;
        }

        .moscarossa-image-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }

        .moscarossa-image-card {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .moscarossa-image-card.is-preview {
            border: 3px solid #d71939;
            padding: 8px;
        }

        .moscarossa-image-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 190px;
            object-fit: cover;
            background: #eee;
        }

        .moscarossa-image-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 5px;
            margin-top: 9px;
        }

        .moscarossa-image-actions .btn {
            flex: 1 1 42px;
        }

        .moscarossa-save-row {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .moscarossa-pending-note {
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="scripts-async wysihtml5-supported menu-left-visible">
    <input id="annuncioID" type="hidden" value="new">
    <input id="donnaID" type="hidden" value="new">

    <div class="container-fluid menu-hidden" style="visibility: visible;">
        <%- include('../../partials/menu'); %>
        <div id="content">
            <%- include('../../partials/header'); %>
            <h1 id="moscarossaPageTitle">Nuovo Annuncio Moscarossa</h1>

            <div class="innerLR">
                <div class="widget widget-heading-simple widget-body-gray widget-annuncio">
                    <div class="widget-head">
                        <h3 class="heading"><i class="fa fa-edit"></i> Informazioni annuncio</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="widget-body">
                        <img class="moscarossa-logo" src="/assets/panels/moscarossa.png" alt="Moscarossa">

                        <form id="moscarossaInfoForm" novalidate>
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaCategory">Categoria *</label>
                                        <select id="moscarossaCategory" name="categorie" class="form-control" required>
                                            <option value="">Seleziona una categoria</option>
                                            <option value="DONNAUOMO">Escort donne</option>
                                            <option value="TRANS">Trans</option>
                                            <option value="UOMODONNA">Gigolò</option>
                                            <option value="MASSAGGI">Massaggi</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaName">Nome *</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaName" name="name" type="text" maxlength="30" class="form-control" required>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="moscarossaTitle">Titolo *</label>
                                <textarea id="moscarossaTitle" name="title" maxlength="150" rows="2" class="form-control" required></textarea>
                            </div>

                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="moscarossaDescription">Descrizione *</label>
                                <textarea id="moscarossaDescription" name="description" rows="8" class="form-control" required></textarea>
                                <p class="help-block">Minimo 20 caratteri.</p>
                            </div>

                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaPhone">Telefono *</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaPhone" name="phone" type="tel" maxlength="50" class="form-control" required>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="moscarossa-contact-options">
                                        <label><input name="whatsapp" type="checkbox"> WhatsApp</label>
                                        <label><input name="telegram" type="checkbox"> Telegram</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaAge">Età</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaAge" name="age" type="number" min="18" max="99" class="form-control">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <hr>

                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaCity">Comune *</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaCity" name="city" type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Scrivi una città/comune" required>
                                        <p class="help-block">La ricerca automatica Moscarossa sarà collegata quando sarà disponibile la relativa API.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaZone">Zona/quartiere</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaZone" name="location" type="text" class="form-control">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaAddress">Indirizzo</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaAddress" name="address" type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Es: Via Roma, 1">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaZoneDetail">Dettaglio zona</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaZoneDetail" name="zoneDetail" type="text" maxlength="150" class="form-control" placeholder="Es: vicino alla stazione">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label for="moscarossaWebsite">Sito web personale</label>
                                        <input id="moscarossaWebsite" name="website" type="url" maxlength="250" class="form-control">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6">
                                    <div class="form-group">
                                        <label class="checkbox-inline" style="margin-top: 26px;">
                                            <input id="moscarossaAirConditioned" name="airConditioned" type="checkbox"> Ambiente climatizzato
                                        </label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <input id="moscarossaZoneId" name="zoneId" type="hidden">
                            <input id="moscarossaLatitude" name="latitude" type="hidden">
                            <input id="moscarossaLongitude" name="longitude" type="hidden">

                            <div class="row moscarossa-save-row">
                                <div class="col-md-12">
                                    <button id="moscarossaSaveInfo" type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">
                                        <i class="fa fa-save"></i> SALVA INFORMAZIONI
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="widget widget-heading-simple widget-body-gray">
                    <div class="widget-head">
                        <h3 class="heading"><i class="fa fa-camera"></i> Foto</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div class="widget-body">
                        <p>Massimo 20 foto, 5 MB per immagine. Seleziona una foto come anteprima.</p>
                        <input id="moscarossaImages" type="file" class="form-control" accept="image/*" multiple>
                        <p id="moscarossaNewAdImageHelp" class="help-block moscarossa-pending-note" style="display:none;">
                            Salva prima le informazioni dell'annuncio, quindi aggiungi le immagini.
                        </p>
                        <div id="moscarossaImageGrid" class="moscarossa-image-grid"></div>
                        <button id="moscarossaSaveImages" type="button" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;" disabled>
                            <i class="fa fa-save"></i> SALVA FOTO E ANTEPRIMA
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="alert alert-warning">
                    Il pannello Moscarossa salva informazioni, foto e anteprima. Le programmazioni saranno abilitate
                    dopo aver integrato il secondo passaggio del sito Moscarossa.
                </div>
            </div>

            <footer>
                <%- include('../../partials/footer'); %>
            </footer>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/panels/moscarossa/main.js?v=20260803-panel-phase1"></script>
</body>

</html>
